   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "28239bfa-66ca-424f-a055-3659e33bab52"],
 " without a connection is the least angle over the list."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a7281afc-eea4-4127-9828-fff3ca06b30d"],

Cell["\<\
The Levi-Civita realisations are listed in full, with no cap. A long walk \
through vertices with many directions can give many of them.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5107dfe5-79cc-4610-8cd8-61bb0bd4b0b7"],

Cell["Options of the Levi-Civita form:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"f9306509-541c-48cd-aefe-03bc6dcfbd78"],

